{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43025","headline":"古意 · 戴休珽","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷秋朔风起，沧海愁阴涨。\n虏骑掠河南，汉兵屯灞上。\n羽书惊沙漠，刁斗喧亭障。\n关塞何苍茫，遥烽递相望。\n弱龄负奇节，侠客多招访。\n投笔弃繻生，提戈逐飞将。\n拔劒照霜白，怒发冲冠壮。\n会立万里功，视君封侯相。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴休珽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}